~ blocked
do disable_movement()
Stone and vine, piled across the gap on purpose. You could shift it with an axe. You don't have one.
do enable_movement()
=> END

~ hint
do disable_movement()
Stone and vine, held together by the vines. A few good swings of the axe should bring it down.
do enable_movement()
=> END

~ cleared
do disable_movement()
The pile comes apart easier than it looks.
do enable_movement()
=> END
